# 基本文章編集から運び出すもの (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. A copy of 基本文章編集 whose
# record 0 is the text below (xmlbig) is opened at 100,100: a line, a line with a bold word and a
# red word, a figure standing in a line, and a last line. Carried by the hand, the button let go
# at once each time:
#   1. 太字の語と赤い語, picked, out of the window onto the document TADjsについて that the
#      desktop opened at the start (a window of the text editor's process): they go there as
#      one line of letters, and leave the copy
#   2. 先頭, picked, out of the window and back onto the end of the last line: they move there
#      (the desktop answers the process DT_F_BACK, and it moves them within its text)
#   3. the figure, out of the window and back onto the end of the last line: it moves there
#   4. the figure, from there onto TADjsについて: no window takes a figure carried out of a
#      text but the text's own (the desktop's windows hold no text, and a program's is given
#      letters and links only), so it is refused and stays in the copy
# Record 0 of the copy, saved, is the one 1, 2 and 3 make. The desktop's own text editor, since
# removed, took 1 and 4 into a document of its own: what the copy came to then is no longer
# what is wanted.
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
# The record wanted is the process's own: what the desktop's own editor, since removed, made
# with 受け先 of its own is no longer reachable.
mkbig doc 3
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>先頭の行です。</p>
xml <p>前<bold>太字の語</bold>と<font color="#ff0000">赤い語</font>の後</p>
xml <p>A<figure><figView left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/><figDraw left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/><rect l_pat="1" left="10" top="10" right="110" bottom="50"/></figure>B</p>
xml <p>最後の行です。</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 4
wait 800
logmark
